{
 "_": [
  "The item lists for the costume room's five storage spaces. tools/genstores.py turns this into",
  "poh_store.enum and poh_store.inv, and refuses to write anything if a name is not in",
  "pack/obj.pack, if an item is already in the treasure chest's own list, or if the same item",
  "appears in two stores.",
  "",
  "The rule for what belongs: it has to already exist in this repo, it has to be something you",
  "WEAR or PLAY WITH rather than something you use, and it must not be a treasure trail reward -",
  "those are the treasure chest's. The three berets and the highwayman mask were cut for exactly",
  "that reason.",
  "",
  "The TIERS are not here; they are in tools/furnspec.json under the family named by 'family',",
  "because they are furniture and that is where furniture lives."
